rooms_desc ({"This is the entrence hall of the manor. There are several gatesavailable for easy access to the church, shop, or adventurer'sguild. A door leads south to the main building. There is a coat-hanger in the corner where you can put your hat and coat ifyou want to.","the floor is inlaid with marble tiers, a woolen rug lies on inThere is a fireplace in the corner, a large candlelamp hangson the ceiling. A table and chairs in the corner are there foryour comfort. you can put your coat and hat on the coatstand.","This is the bedroom of the mistress of the house. A LARGE bed occupiesmost of the space in this room. Several closets line the walls.As you glance upwards, you notice that the entire ceiling consistsof a mirror!","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","The living is large, with a fireplace positioned in the center, so thatseveral people can sit around it. A leather couch is standing face toface with a large tv. The walls are lined with cupboards, filled withbooks. On a small table are a few magazines.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",})
