items ({({"coathanger","A black, brass coathanger. The hooks are fashionably made of little skulls",}),0,({"bed","a comfy bed, filled with cushions. You get the inpression that it'll be a very good place for all sorts of things. You notice a copy of the kama sutra besides it",}),0,({"living room","The living room is very large, a fireplace is positioned in the center","of the room. Several cupboards filled with books line the walls.","A large comfortable looking couch stands in one corner, directly","opposite a big tv. On a table near the couch are several magazines.","**",}),({"q","","q","**",}),0,0,0,0,})
